<h2>Why we're cheaper than an agency</h2>
<p>Not because we cut corners — because of focus. We build one type of website for one type of business. We're not relearning your industry on your invoice, and we don't have a CBD office to pay for. That efficiency is the entire discount.</p>
<p>What we don't do: bespoke e-commerce, booking platforms, custom web apps. If you need those, a full agency is genuinely the right call and we'll say so on the call.</p>

<h2>After launch: the Get Found Plan</h2>
<p>A website gets you found once. Staying found is a different job — Google rewards profiles that stay active and demotes ones that go quiet.</p>
<p>The Get Found Plan is <strong>{{ site.planPriceDisplay }}</strong> and covers hosting, SSL, backups and security, monthly Google Business Profile management, ongoing local SEO, the review-generation system, monthly reporting, and small site updates.</p>
<p>Your first month is included in the build price and the plan starts from day 30. There's no lock-in — cancel any time. It is required to keep the Jobs In {{ site.guaranteeDays }} Guarantee active, for the reason set out on the <a href="/guarantee/">guarantee page</a>: a site nobody is managing can't be guaranteed to rank.</p>

<h2>What you're not charged for</h2>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Scope creep.</strong> The quote is the price. Extra work is quoted separately and you can say no.</li>
  <li><strong>Ransom fees.</strong> You own the site and the domain outright. Host it anywhere.</li>
  <li><strong>Lock-in contracts.</strong> There aren't any.</li>
  <li><strong>The rebuild, if we miss.</strong> No genuine job enquiry in {{ site.guaranteeDays }} days and we rebuild free.</li>
</ul>

